    - docs/kos-comn/normative/NS-1-KSCL-CORE-SPECIFICATION.en.md
    - docs/kos-comn/normative/NS-2-KSCL-SEMANTIC-CONSTRUCTS.en.md
    - docs/kos-comn/normative/NS-3-KSCL-SEMANTIC-CONFORMANCE-FRAMEWORK.en.md
    - docs/kos-comn/normative/NS-4-KSCL-PROFILES-EXTENSIONS-COMPOSITION.en.md
    - docs/kos-comn/normative/NS-5-KSCL-SERIALIZATION-SEMANTIC-EXCHANGE.en.md
    - docs/kos-comn/normative/NS-6-KSCL-VALIDATION-VERIFICATION-CERTIFICATION.en.md
    - docs/kos-comn/normative/NS-7-KSCL-GOVERNANCE-EVOLUTION-LIFECYCLE.en.md

notes:
  - CURRENT.kscl is continuity state only.
  - ARCHITECTURE.kscl holds frozen architectural decisions.
  - HISTORY.kscl logs the chronological evolution of decisions.
  - DECISIONS.kscl enumerates decision records with stable identifiers.
  - Localizations are separate files with semantically equivalent content and stable identifiers.
